'' EACH LIBRARY ONCE ON THE LINK LINE. Every '#inclib' and every 'declare ... lib' went on
'' as asked, and each module replayed its own list, so a WebView2 example over seven tkl
'' modules named user32, dwmapi and propsys hundreds of times each. lld reads archives in
'' any order: the first mention stays, the repeats -- case-folded on COFF, and 'x.dll'
'' as the '-lx' it becomes -- go.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -v -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/link-dedupe-libs.bas -o tests/driver/linkdedupelibs.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: "-lshlwapi" "-lcomctl32" "
'' EXPECT-NOT: "-lSHLWAPI"
'' EXPECT-NOT: "-lcomctl32" "-lshlwapi"
'' EXPECT-NOT: "-lcomctl32" "-lcomctl32"
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/linkdedupelibs.exe
'' RUN: tests/driver/linkdedupelibs.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok -1
